{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17936","headline":"秋怀诗十一首 九 · 韩愈","name":"秋怀诗十一首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霜风侵梧桐，衆叶着树乾。\n空堦一片下，琤若摧琅玕。\n谓是夜气灭，望舒霣其团。\n青冥无依倚，飞辙危难安。\n惊起出户视，倚楹久丸澜。\n忧愁费晷景，日月如跳丸。\n迷复不计远，爲君驻尘鞍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}